## solution

#### using a stack

```js
const befittingBrackets = (str) => {
  const stack = [];

  const brackets = {
    '(': ')',
    '[': ']',
    '{': '}'
  };

  for (let char of str) {
    if (char in brackets) {
      stack.push(brackets[char]);
    } else {
      if (stack.length > 0 && stack[stack.length - 1] === char) {
        stack.pop();
      } else {
        return false;
      }
    }
  }

  return stack.length === 0;
};
```

- n = length of string
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

